{"html":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><header class=\"border-b border-border pb-6 pt-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-4\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-[1_1_20rem]\"><h1 class=\"text-[28px] font-bold leading-[1.05] text-foreground\">Avaliação Institucional</h1><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Responda aos questionários de avaliação da instituição. Dá pra salvar e terminar depois.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 h-0.5 w-12 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></header><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[linear-gradient(100deg,var(--card)_0%,var(--card)_42%,var(--primary-soft)_100%)] px-4 text-foreground shadow-md sm:px-6 sm:py-5 xl:px-8 xl:py-6 border-b-4 border-primary py-5\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(8rem,14rem)] lg:items-center lg:gap-x-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h2 class=\"text-xl leading-tight font-bold text-balance sm:text-2xl\">Nenhuma avaliação pendente</h2><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-balance\">Responda aos questionários sobre cursos, professores e infraestrutura. Você pode salvar e continuar depois.</p><p class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>O sigilo das respostas é garantido no processo avaliativo.</p></div><div class=\"relative -my-4 hidden self-stretch lg:block\"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-1/2 -z-10 h-full w-auto max-w-none -translate-x-1/2 object-contain object-bottom select-none\" src=\"/replica/online-review.svg\"></div></div></section><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-xl border text-center border-dashed border-border bg-surface px-6 py-12\"><span class=\"mb-4 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-card border border-dashed border-border\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check size-5 text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"font-normal text-[15px] text-foreground\">Nenhum questionário disponível agora.</p><p class=\"mt-1 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Quando um período de avaliação abrir para você, os questionários aparecem aqui.</p></div></div></div></div>"}